@startuml UML-BACKGROUND-JOB-STATE-MACHINE
title Background Job State Machine
[*] --> Queued
Queued --> Leased
Leased --> Running
Running --> Succeeded
Running --> Retrying : transient failure
Retrying --> Queued : backoff elapsed
Running --> Failed : permanent/exhausted
Running --> Cancelled : cancellation
Leased --> Queued : lease expired
Succeeded --> [*]
Failed --> [*]
Cancelled --> [*]
@enduml
